ue] [17592186245899 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}x^{-4}" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245899 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533673 true] [17592186245899 1111 #uuid "94d696fe-4b2d-55cf-9ff1-99055f24ebe2" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245901 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1089 "q-343114" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1100 "Given $f(x)=2ln⁡x+{x}^{4},$ we have\n\n${f}^{‴}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}." 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1113 #uuid "7891f6b5-04df-57d0-aa50-3e1688cc9d59" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1138 false 13194139533673 true] [17592186245900 1145 "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2ln⁡x+{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{x}+4{x}^{3} \\\\  & =2{x}^{-1}+4{x}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{-1}+4{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =-2{x}^{-2}+12{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{-2}+12{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =4{x}^{-3}+24x \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}+24x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245902 13194139533673 true] [17592186245901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245903 13194139533673 true] [17592186245901 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533673 true] [17592186245901 1041 "field-1" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245901 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245903 13194139533673 true] [17592186245901 1110 #uuid "b4720fdb-7da3-5e1b-bfd6-d997cd609cd5" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245902 1034 "-4x^{-3}+24x" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245902 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533673 true] [17592186245902 1111 #uuid "0b772a37-e8b0-5a6e-961d-27948ec23264" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245903 1034 "4x^{-3}+24x" 13194139533673 true] [17592186245903 1103 #edb/ref 